{"summary":"golf + puzzle + cards","description":"Golf Peaks is a chill puzzle game about climbing misty mountains by playing golf. Choose cards to move the ball around, avoid hazards or use them to your advantage, solve over 120 handcrafted levels and become the master of Golf Peaks!\n\nUNIQUE GOLF PUZZLES\nYou start each stage with a selection of cards (strokes) - pick the right one, choose a direction and launch your ball towards the hole!\n\nZERO UNDERSTANDING OF GOLF REQUIRED\nGolf Peaks offers a fun experience even if you don’t know your eagles from bogeys - the game’s textless tutorial introduces everything you need at a relaxed pace.\n\n120+ HOLES TO CONQUER\nEach location offers a half-course with 9 holes to solve, along with a bonus short course (3 holes) for players seeking an additional challenge!\n\nBUNKERS, PITS & MORE\nOver the course of the game you’ll encounter familiar golf-inspired mechanics like fairways, sand traps and water... as well as some more exotic hazards!","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":null,"video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/exnzacP2zUc?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/2sn5Zd0Zx-Cp3dLVp5KahN16gWeiMj3cknNZY_64y0aed3cdokN8q7g8EH-Vb6eOHP6ui590q0X4ovD7ZE8I","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/vvLKMttdqSijnPGfovmQqzzcu9HyLA6KeT_wzXCKOtnLcdwmm3ryQDMxqPTTJNlhf6jROQbtIXtEUoj5VtGayw","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Ce4_VRkzC6cVRMTig0rBbF5K3CQKI_iAPGpYydOVJktmK-G7LcsIRbY-JqxgdqB6TwGNs5_ASyVGd7ZTh2CcxpA","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/SPuqj0x769sZL4h3vCXwUlYH2MADIKAD6611EOq3RlDN8cugkQRepLiRvJ0QA285fsVDcU-P1B9SR9XD_mPp","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/woLvs21C7ZKlNFvP8IBfG3uoEWHCn5s20-_xyAZQfPVfZeWMcBnBeWiof9BZ9KV1ISauMxvjT0WUJzj9AGlT","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/GAwQd5NNckUk3xvgnsiolt733ab1P51I-j8-frxQzH1SSkBBOPAFVZXTI_srJwUef_B53ig4p2oPSXJQp2DoHg","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/uuoGOioUCCHSYNel6zZSEsWfWZFirg-qbGs-CJV